[background arg="res://assets/backgrounds/BlackBaground.png" fade="1.0" wait="true"]
Shateroo, cemetery.
[wait time="1.0"]
[background arg="res://assets/backgrounds/cemetery_day.png" fade="0.0"]
join Simon (Simon_normal) center
if {CharaMeeting.meet_simon} == false:
	Narrator: The cemetery gate creaks. A tall man in a black coat is polishing a headstone, murmuring to it like an old friend.
	join Simon center
	catherine: Good … morning, I am sorry to disturb you but I have a few questions to ask.
	Simon: *surprised* A GHOST ?  Who are you ? What are you doing here ?
	catherine: I am not a ghost, I might look pale and frail but I am still alive.
	catherine: But since you are here, can you do me a favor? You see, I am looking for how to say that ?
	Simon: GHOSTS !?
	catherine: What ? Ghost ? no ? What’s up with you and ghosts ?
	Simon: I am joking, kids like you are previsible. Hi. I am Simon.
	set {CharaMeeting.meet_simon} = true
	Simon: Let me guess, you heard of legends around this town and are looking for a quick buck ? Right ?
	- Admit it
		catherine: Yes, you got me. But it’s not about money. I want to live.
		catherine: I want to live my life to the fullest.
		catherine: And I heard, or more accurately, my late mother told me that there is something, I mean, someone who could cure me here.
		Simon: I get it, It’s understandable. But beware, your own desire might be perceived as greed by others. By others, I mean non-human creatures. They are after all, just souls like us
		Simon: I assume you’ve already seen one before. I can’t fathom someone going here and not seeing one. And tourists tend to leave really fast after such an encounter.
		catherine: So, are you willing to help me ?
		Simon: Help you ? for god's sake. No. But I can assure you that you will meet one of them every evening here. You wil run in what you are searching for soon enough.
		catherine: That is not really a useful informations.
		Simon (Simon_angry): You can't have everything in life kid, now leave. I have a job to finish.
		catherine: I don't really have a life.
		Simon (Simon_angry): I SAID LEAVE NOW !
		leave Simon
		set {ChapterTracking.is_evil} = false
		set {EndingTracking.catherine_sympathy} += 1.0
	- Deny it
		catherine: No, what are you talking about ? A quick buck ? Me ? Of course not. I am just here to… visit.
		Simon: Don't make me laugh kid. I saw you yesterday. There is no way you haven’t seen something or someone unusual in this town.
		Simon: But listen, if you really want to be stubborn.
		Simon: What might seem as simple desire in your mind will be interpreted as pure greed by other creatures. And that will kill you. I will keep a place for you here.
		Simon: I just hope to see you again, alaive and breathing.
		leave Simon
		set {ChapterTracking.is_evil} = true
		set {EndingTracking.catherine_sympathy} -= 1.0
else:
	Narrator: Simon is polishing a gravestone when Catherine approaches.
	Simon (Simon_what): Back again, I am impressed you are still alive. My wish came true after all.
	catherine: I'm beginning to think you expected me but anyway, I may be leaving soon.
	Simon (Simon_surprised): Ah, it’s not like I didn’t expect it.
	- Tell Simon you have failed
		catherine: I found what I was looking for.
		catherine: And he doesn’t wanna do anything for me.
		Simon (Simon_talking): I see. Letting you leave is already something if it’s the one I know.
		catherine: And that's all? Nothing else?
		Simon: What would you have me say? You already got your answer, right?
		catherine: I don't know. You don't seem very frightened by death, do you? Because I am.
		Simon: I've spent half my life talking to people who are already dead.
		catherine: And does it make it easier?
		Simon: No. It merely teaches one that being afraid does not make death wait.
		leave Simon
		set {ChapterTracking.is_evil} = false
		set {EndingTracking.catherine_sympathy} += 1.0
	- Ask if Simon knows another way
		catherine: If you know so much about this place, surely there must be something I haven't heard.
		Simon (Simon_what): There are always rumours, always. But you don’t need rumors anymore, right. You need a miracle
		catherine: Yes, it's kind of obvious.
		Simon (Simon_talking): Miracles have a habit of becoming tragedies when desperate people go looking for them.
		catherine: I don’t understand your blabbering. I am going to find a way to do what this...thing... told me to.
		Simon (Simon_surprised): Hahahaha, such ego. As I said before, just don’t die
		catherine: If I don’t do anything, I will die.
		leave Simon
		set {ChapterTracking.is_evil} = true
		set {EndingTracking.catherine_sympathy} += 1.0
audio music - [loop="true"]
